{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bandeirantes invites the player to experience the life of one of the bandeirantes, who explored Brazil in the 17th century. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes place in the year 1650 and the player's objective is to organize and lead a Bandeira within the state of S\u00e3o Paulo and parts of Minas Gerais, Goi\u00e1s, Mato Grosso do Sul and Paran\u00e1. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy carts, animals, food, water, tools, weapons and hire bandeirantes in 10 different classes to fulfill your objective: Expand the map of Brazil and find riches such as Gold, Silver, Precious Stones and other minerals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies include the terrain, diseases, wild animals and Spanish invadors who did not respect the Treaty of Tordesihas.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Game Mechanics include Plantation, Work, Negotiation with Indigenous People, Hunting, Fishing, Village Construction, Karma for your Decisions, amongs others. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come be a modern Bandeirante and show what would you do to be the best among them all.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3233630?t=1745112658","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233630/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745112658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233630/2b0b31aa786f218bbc2a602e6586104c36771174/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745112658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233630/2b0b31aa786f218bbc2a602e6586104c36771174/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745112658","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The player will need to defend himself from wild animals and bandits."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bandeirantes invites the player to experience the life of one of the bandeirantes, who explored Brazil in the 17th century. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes place in the year 1650 and the player's objective is to organize and lead a Bandeira within the state of S\u00e3o Paulo and parts of Minas Gerais, Goi\u00e1s, Mato Grosso do Sul and Paran\u00e1. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy carts, animals, food, water, tools, weapons and hire bandeirantes in 10 different classes to fulfill your objective: Expand the map of Brazil and find riches such as Gold, Silver, Precious Stones and other minerals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies include the terrain, diseases, wild animals and Spanish invadors who did not respect the Treaty of Tordesihas.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Game Mechanics include Plantation, Work, Negotiation with Indigenous People, Hunting, Fishing, Village Construction, Karma for your Decisions, amongs others. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come be a modern Bandeirante and show what would you do to be the best among them all.</p>","developers":["Neo Argo Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233630/header.jpg?t=1745112658","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116745,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116745/movie480.mp4?t=1742476194","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116745/movie_max.mp4?t=1742476194"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets